Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A longship cuts through the fog,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.01,0:00:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,its striped sail rising over the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.01,0:00:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So where did the Vikings actually
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.80,0:00:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.02,0:00:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mostly from Scandinavia—the\Nregions we now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.94,0:00:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,call Norway, Denmark, and Sweden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.46,0:00:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But there was no single Viking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,During the Viking Age, roughly the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,late eighth to eleventh centuries,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Scandinavians sailed abroad to\Nraid, trade,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.83,0:00:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,explore, and settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Some headed west to Britain,\NIceland,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Greenland,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and eventually North America.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Others traveled east along rivers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,toward the Baltic, Byzantium, and\Nbeyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.36,0:00:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Vikings did not emerge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.05,0:00:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,from one mysterious homeland.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.86,0:00:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They came from different\NScandinavian societies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,“Viking” wasn’t simply where\Nsomeone was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,from—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.28,0:00:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,it was connected to what some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Scandinavians went out into the\Nworld
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.92,0:00:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,it was connected to what some
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.01,0:00:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Scandinavians went out into the\Nworld
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.11,0:00:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,to do.
